# Trivy CVE suppressions for the TabLedger image (generated paths verified 2026-10-03).
#
# These three findings are the copies of msgpack/urllib3/setuptools VENDORED
# INSIDE pip's own bootstrap directory (site-packages/pip/_vendor/, versions
# match pip's vendor.txt exactly).  They are not importable by the
# application and never used at runtime; the real (non-vendored) packages
# are constrained to patched versions via docker/constraints.txt.
# CI additionally passes --skip-dirs to exclude the vendor path entirely.
